#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-notifications.rst:2
msgid "Build failure notifications"
msgstr "构建失败通知"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-notifications.rst:4
msgid ""
"Build notifications can alert you when your documentation builds fail so you"
" can take immediate action. We offer the following methods for being "
"notified:"
msgstr "构建通知可在文档构建失败时提醒你，以便立即采取行动。我们提供以下通知方式："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-notifications.rst:7
msgid "Email notifications:"
msgstr "邮件通知："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-notifications.rst:8
msgid ""
"Read the Docs allows you to configure build notifications via email. When "
"builds fail, configured email addresses are notified."
msgstr "Read the Docs 允许你通过邮件配置构建通知。构建失败时，会通知配置的邮箱地址。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-notifications.rst:12
msgid "Build Status Webhooks:"
msgstr "构建状态 Webhook："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-notifications.rst:13
msgid ""
"Build notifications can happen via :term:`webhooks <webhook>`. This means "
"that we are able to support a wide variety of services that receive "
"notifications."
msgstr "构建通知可通过 :term:`webhooks <webhook>` 进行。这意味着我们能支持各种接收通知的服务。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-notifications.rst:16
msgid "Slack and Discord are supported through ready-made templates."
msgstr "Slack 和 Discord 通过现成的模板提供支持。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-notifications.rst:18
msgid ""
"Webhooks can be customized through your own template and a variety of "
"variable substitutions."
msgstr "Webhook 可通过你自己的模板和多种变量替换进行定制。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-notifications.rst:22
msgid ""
"We don't trigger email notifications or build status webhooks on "
":doc:`builds from pull requests </pull-requests>`."
msgstr "我们不会在 :doc:`Pull Request 构建 </pull-requests>` 上触发邮件通知或构建状态 Webhook。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-notifications.rst:25
msgid ":doc:`/guides/build/email-notifications`"
msgstr ":doc:`/guides/build/email-notifications`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-notifications.rst:26
msgid ""
"Enable email notifications on failed builds, so you always know that your "
"docs are deploying successfully."
msgstr "启用构建失败的邮件通知，这样你就能随时知道文档是否部署成功。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-notifications.rst:29
msgid ":doc:`/guides/build/webhooks`"
msgstr ":doc:`/guides/build/webhooks`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-notifications.rst:30
msgid ""
"Steps for setting up build notifications via webhooks, including examples "
"for popular platforms like Slack and Discord."
msgstr "通过 Webhook 设置构建通知的步骤，包括针对 Slack、Discord 等流行平台的示例。"

